{
  "title": "umosim: A fast, extensible, agent-based model of smart sustainable mobility services, markets, and policies",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "<h2>Short Description</h2><p>We simulate shared mobility services (e.g. ride hailing, vehicle sharing), the infrastructure they use (e.g. charging), and the markets that link them to users (e.g., Mobility-as-a-Service) and to each other (e.g. charging slot auctions).</p><h2>Documentation</h2><p>For more information, please visit our user and developer guide at <a href=\"https://umosim.readthedocs.io/\">https://umosim.readthedocs.io/</a>.</p>",
